<in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock contextRef="OneD">Notes:  n  n1. The Board has recommended a dividend of Rs.2 (Rupees Two) per equity share of Rs.10/- each for the FY 2018-19.  n  n2. The Register of Members and Share Transfer Books of the Company will remain closed from Wednesday, the 17th July 2019 to Tuesday, the 23rd July 2019 (both days inclusive).  n  n3. Revenue till 30th June 2017 was inclusive of excise duty while GST from 01st July 2017 is not included in Revenue in accordance with 'Ind AS 115'. For comparability, Revenue for the previous year excluding excise duty is Rs.19464 lakhs.  n  n4. Sugar production being seasonal, performance of one quarter is not indicative of the trend for the whole year.  n  n5. Figures for last quarter are the difference between the audited figures for the full financial year and the published figures for nine months period upto the third quarter of the relevant financial year.  n  n6. Figures for the previous period have been regrouped wherever necessary.  n  n7. Exceptional items comprise of (Rs. Lakhs) tttQuarterttYear  ntttttttendedttended  nttttttt           31-03-2019  n  n(i) Indirect tax demands contestedtttt102tt102  n(ii) Electricity - Parallel Operation Chargesttt31tt31  n  n8. Sugar prices continue to remain unviable under supply glut. Sugarcane availability is constrained by water stress. Liquidity is strained by inordinate delay in realizing power dues.  n  n9. The above financial results were reviewed by the Audit Committee and approved by the Board of Directors at the respective meetings held on 24th May, 2019.  n  n  nttttttttFor Ponni Sugars (Erode) Limited  n  ntttttttttN Ramanathan  nChennaitttttttt             Managing Director  n24-05-2019ttttt </in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock>
